---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Игорь — Системный аналитик">
  <section class="relative space-y-10">
   <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute left-1/3 top-20 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-sky-500/10 blur-3xl"></div>

    <div class="absolute right-1/4 top-96 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-cyan-400/10 blur-3xl"></div>
</div>
    <div>
      <p class="mb-4 text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-sky-400">
        Portfolio / System Analysis / AI
      </p>

      <h1 class="mb-6 text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-100">
        Игорь — системный аналитик
      </h1>

      <p class="max-w-3xl text-xl leading-8 text-slate-300">
        Проектирую требования, интеграции, API, модели данных и backend-процессы.
        Работаю на стыке системного анализа, баз данных, legacy replacement и AI/LLM.
      </p>
    </div>

<div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
  <a
    href="https://github.com/igortau"
    target="_blank"
	rel="noopener noreferrer"
    class="rounded-xl border border-slate-700 px-5 py-3 text-slate-200 transition hover:border-sky-500 hover:bg-slate-900"
  >
    GitHub
  </a>

  <a
    href="https://hh.ru/resume/be4bbe13ff061127440039ed1f426245417655"
    target="_blank"
	rel="noopener noreferrer"
    class="rounded-xl border border-slate-700 px-5 py-3 text-slate-200 transition hover:border-sky-500 hover:bg-slate-900"
  >
    HH.ru
  </a>

  <a
    href="https://t.me/igortaurg"
    target="_blank"
	rel="noopener noreferrer"
    class="rounded-xl border border-slate-700 px-5 py-3 text-slate-200 transition hover:border-sky-500 hover:bg-slate-900"
  >
    Telegram
  </a>
</div>

<div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
  <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-sky-700 hover:bg-slate-800/80 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-sky-950">
    <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-100">Интеграции</h2>
    <p class="text-slate-400">
      REST API, Kafka, контракты, sequence diagrams, взаимодействие сервисов.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-sky-700 hover:bg-slate-800/80 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-sky-950">
    <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-100">Данные</h2>
    <p class="text-slate-400">
      PostgreSQL, ERD, НСИ, правила выбора данных, миграция legacy-моделей.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-sky-700 hover:bg-slate-800/80 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-sky-950">
    <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-100">AI / LLM</h2>
    <p class="text-slate-400">
      Ollama, OpenWebUI, RAG, pgvector, AI-агенты и семантический поиск.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="pt-10">
  <h2 class="mb-6 text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">
    Tech Stack
  </h2>

  <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
    <span class="rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
  PostgreSQL
</span>

<span class="rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
  REST API
</span>

<span class="rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
  Kafka
</span>

<span class="rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
  Docker
</span>

<span class="rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
  BPMN
</span>

<span class="rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
  UML
</span>

<span class="rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
  Ollama
</span>

<span class="rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
  RAG
</span>

<span class="rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
  pgvector
</span>
  </div>
</div>

  </section>
</BaseLayout>